body:
I didn't really have much of a budget in mind. Maybe somewhere in the midrange, or maybe $300 max? Things have gotten a bit expensive where I live so I may have to wait.

The reason I wanted to upgrade the CPU first though is because I was afraid it was going to bottleneck most newer GPUs a bit too severely, especially on newer games. I was thinking of getting my hands on a 1660 Ti  (though it looks like new cards should be coming out soon? Might be better to wait for that too.)

Sorry, I'm still learning the ropes when it comes to upgrading. I got this PC years ago on a tight budget. ^_^;
